{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18579","headline":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇 · 柳宗元","name":"唐铙歌妓吹曲十二篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东蛮有谢氏，冠带理海中。\n自言我异世，虽圣莫能通。\n王卒如飞翰，鹏骞骇羣龙。\n轰然自天坠，乃信神武功。\n系虏君臣人，累累来自东。\n无思不服从，唐业如山崇。\n百辟拜稽首，咸愿图形容。\n如周王会书，永永传无穷。\n睢盱万状乖，咿嗢九译重。\n广轮抚四海，浩浩知皇风。\n歌诗铙鼓闲，以壮我元戎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18579.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18579","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}